<<~ ahu slot=`#/placement-hand-back`>>

! Placement hand-back

The placement leap remains incomplete and must not be treated as ready for founding. The operator's ruling requires the full feature before founding; this hand-back records the concrete blocker and the unfinished work accurately.

* ''Step 1 — walk fix:'' implemented in `lares-cli` carrier gathering. A directory LOAD omits only its catalog-owned root manifest. Red coverage and prior touched-package checks are recorded in `PLACE-STEP-1.md`.
* ''Step 2 — measure:'' inventory completed, including mailbox, delegate/face-row, lease epoch, swarm, ward audit and persona-act copies. Source-to-mirror scope gap and homes are documented in `PLACE-MEASURE.md`.
* ''Step 3 — homes:'' blocked and incomplete. Keyhive now fails closed unless secret custody supplies a separate secret handle and sealed-rest grant. The full vessel secret enrollment, control document migration, writer/reader sweep, persona recipe/browser cleanup and `bags/daemon-<F>` mint/recipe path remain. `PLACE-RULING.md` records the current lean: secrets stay off disk; daemon mirror remains withheld until control writers move. The operator requires restoring the daemon mirror in the completed tree, after that migration.
* ''Step 4 — placement:'' projector and title gates changed; effect records skip by record kind; structural mirror-source checking and private-home LOAD refusal are present. Carry's arbitrary bundle importer still submits INGEST directly and needs the named LOAD-to-working then MOVE road. Daemon mirror withholding is a safety hold, not completion.
* ''Step 5 — witness/canon:'' witness is wired into the witness collection; canon files and adapter paragraph updated. Witness, evergreen boundary and diff check pass. See `PLACE-STEP-5.md`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/verification`>>

!! Verification

Mesh full suite passed: 527 files, 5,117 passed, 20 skipped. Keyhive full suite passed: 97 files, 560 passed. TW5 full suite ran before vendor-core generation and failed on missing generated core and stale seals; it has not been rerun after generation. CLI full suite ran before the latest carry edits and failed old behavior/founding expectations; it has not been rerun. Node full suite completed after mirror edits: 82 failed files, 468 passed; 221 failed tests, 3,234 passed, 59 skipped, one unhandled error. Founding and face tests report `secret-home-unavailable`. Not all five package builds/stamps/typechecks have a final pass against the current tree.

Witnesses run: placement-residency witness passed; evergreen boundary passed; `git diff --check` passed. No Python sensorium suite or e2e suite ran.

<<~/ahu>>

